==Bases==
The Foundation has many different safe houses located around the world. Among these [[Dante's house]], [[Huntik Foundation Italian HQ]], the [[Cathedral of Notre Dame]] in Paris and the [[Prague Huntik Hotel]].

== Members ==
The Foundation is made up many different [[Seeker]]s and Seeker teams. Among the best Seekers in the Huntik Foundation, [[Dante Vale]] is officially ranked number one, with [[Montehue]] ranked second. {{Source|The Legacy of Thor}} A typical Foundation operative is smart, spunky, and curious. He or she has a nose for a mystery and a keen sense of justice. Foundation operatives value teammates and work together in order to make the world a better place. Some members however prefer to remain out of the field. These operatives are usually profilers who remain at safe houses and research new ways to stop the Organization. {{Source|Divide and Conquer}}

== Missions ==
''See the full list of [[List of Huntik Foundation Missions|Huntik Foundation Missions]]''{{clear}}
Missions are assigned to Huntik Foundation teams by the [[Huntik Foundation Council]], with all data sent via Holotome. These missions involve uncovering more information regarding [[magic]] and [[Titans]] as well as preventing [[the Organization]] from achieving their nefarious goals. Many notable missions were assigned by [[Guggenheim]] to the team of [[Dante Vale]], [[Sophie Casterwill]], [[Lok Lambert]], [[Zhalia Moon]], and newcomer [[Den Fears]].

